Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:03.50,TL,,0,0,0,,年初打进布里斯班{\fs78}4{\fs68}强后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.55,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网第四轮 她输给高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:11.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's three in a row for Coco,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N高芙又一次做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:18.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a hat-trick of consecutive Australian Open quarter-finals,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连续第三年打进澳网四分之一决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:21.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but boy did she have to work hard for it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这场胜利赢得可真不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:23.43,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月来到多哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:26.10,TL,,0,0,0,,她上一次拿到巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:28.21,TL,,0,0,0,,还是{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:33.01,TL,,0,0,0,,现在 她又走到决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.33,TL,,0,0,0,,对面 是姆博科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:42.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Such a good finish.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这记收尾打得真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Muchova's magical night.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是属于穆霍娃的梦幻之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The trophy drought is over.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N冠军荒结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:01:01.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Qatar TotalEnergies Open champion, Karolina Muchova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔赛冠军 穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}年多后再次捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:05.67,TL,,0,0,0,,第一座{\fs78}1000{\fs68}分冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.38,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安韦尔斯止步第四轮后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:12.31,TL,,0,0,0,,来到迈阿密{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:14.40,TL,,0,0,0,,对面又是姆博科
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:30.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's magnificent from Karolina Muchova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N穆霍娃打得太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:33.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a point, and what a win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N精彩的一分 精彩的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:36.14,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 又是高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:38.05,TL,,0,0,0,,她再次止步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:40.42,TL,,0,0,0,,斯图加特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:43.21,TL,,0,0,0,,她先在{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛首次击败高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:45.31,TL,,0,0,0,,最终收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:58.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a second Stuttgart title for Elena Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜第{\fs78}2{\fs68}次在斯图加特夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:00.82,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马首战出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:03.93,TL,,0,0,0,,法网又在第三轮负于泰希曼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:11.01,TL,,0,0,0,,草地赛季 柏林第二轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:14.59,TL,,0,0,0,,来到巴特洪堡 大坂因脚伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:17.61,TL,,0,0,0,,她收获首个草地单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:23.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think this might be it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恐怕比赛就要到这里结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:27.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah. Oh, what a desperate shame.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 太令人遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:30.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Holds it aloft.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她高高举起奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:32.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Job well done this week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:36.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And keep myself as healthy as possible and play those matches.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽量保持健康 继续打这些比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:41.05,TL,,0,0,0,,温网半决赛 又是高芙挡在决赛门前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:04.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Karolina Muchova is a Wimbledon finalist.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N穆霍娃闯进了温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:11.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After all the injury setbacks in her career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N经历职业生涯一次次伤病挫折
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:13.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}she knew that if she could get herself{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她知道 只要自己能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:15.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to the start line fit and healthy,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N健康地站上球场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:17.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}she could let her tennis do the talking.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就能让网球替自己说话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:21.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she has been utterly brilliant.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的表现 实在太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.71,0:03:24.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:26.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm really kind of shaking{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我真的还有些发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:28.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and trying to sink it in,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还在试着消化这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:32.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but the atmosphere here, undescribable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这里的氛围 难以形容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:35.21,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘不敌诺斯科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:36.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1300{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:39.53,TL,,0,0,0,,仍是她全年最大的单站收获
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:51.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's over and out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:04.17,TL,,0,0,0,,温网之后 她的赛季出现了停顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.95,TL,,0,0,0,,她接受了一次小手术
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:07.92,TL,,0,0,0,,恢复期间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:11.46,TL,,0,0,0,,缺席了整个北美硬地热身赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.89,TL,,0,0,0,,随后的美网单打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:17.80,TL,,0,0,0,,她在第三轮输给纳瓦罗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:23.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a nice moment between these two,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两人之间这一幕 很温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:25.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because they battled hard in difficult conditions.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她们刚在艰难条件下激烈较量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:29.14,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 她又帮助捷克队赢下金杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:32.86,TL,,0,0,0,,在北京打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:35.00,TL,,0,0,0,,在武汉止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.78,TL,,0,0,0,,温网之后的三站单打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:38.55,TL,,0,0,0,,只增加{\fs78}465{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:41.00,TL,,0,0,0,,最后的资格还没有确定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:47.05,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}20{\fs68}日 斯瓦泰克结束赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:49.51,TL,,0,0,0,,科斯秋克必须打进宁波决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:52.17,TL,,0,0,0,,才能保留争夺资格的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:59.64,TL,,0,0,0,,一天后 她在宁波首盘结束后退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:03.05,TL,,0,0,0,,穆霍娃 就此锁定最后一个席位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:08.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4735{\fs68}分 她把这个起伏的赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:10.55,TL,,0,0,0,,带到了总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:13.72,TL,,0,0,0,,你最期待她打出怎样的网球？
